Hi,

Thanks for sharing this. It looks like a nice application of RTMB with good documentation.
Not sure if I have much to add, but if latent Gaussian random fields would be useful,
it is relatively straight forward to import SPDE type objects via the fmesher package into RTMB.

Hans

